"I'm not a Christian, but is that even a *possible* interpretation?"

No it isn't... though Christians believe in the Father, Son, Spirit, the
prayer is clearly addressed to the Father, and they certainly won't address
God as somehow being his own Father.

source: Yeah I'm one

